14. Accordion versus full commitment

This was considered a strategically relevant structural characteristic.

For each relationship, show whether facilities are:

* fully committed; or
* accordion structures.

Why it matters:

* commitment economics;
* RWA/balance-sheet treatment;
* flexibility to reduce commitments;
* client expectations;
* “moral obligation” concerns raised by management;
