15. Prime RMBS distribution as future upside

A key strategic opportunity discussed was expanding into prime UK RMBS distribution mandates.

The argument:

The bank has spent several years building specialist UK Residential credentials. Those credentials could potentially be used to approach prime lenders/building societies.

Potential targets alluded to included names such as building societies.

Economics:

* lower fees per mandate;
* but little/no balance-sheet consumption;
* therefore high-quality incremental fee revenue.

The deck could therefore frame the franchise as:

Base case

Current lending / warehouse economics.

Upside

* specialist public distribution fees;
* prime RMBS distribution;
* other mandates generated by the same franchise.

This was suggested as part of the pitch for preserving the business.

